WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.233
Open a project or export its Android APK.

00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:18.900
Edit the title and see the preview update.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:28.033
Open the Easy chart from the song checklist.

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:37.200
Place editable notes at the beat markers.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:47.200
Drag an arc with its two taps. Undo restores all three.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:56.467
Check note density and patterns on the 32-note Easy chart.

00:00:56.467 --> 00:01:04.633
Bind cyan stripes to the hold body on Hard.

00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:14.600
Open tap calibration to measure the audio offset.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:23.033
Preview the results screen with the Neon theme.

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:30.767
Preview the same project in Clean Light.

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:39.067
Open the guide for the current editor page.

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:48.067
Open First Steps Studio on the S21 and select Easy.

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:54.767
Open player settings from song selection.

00:01:54.767 --> 00:02:02.767
The active hold head follows the bend across three lanes.

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:11.033
Ground taps and airborne arcs share the playfield.

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:18.533
Curved notes meet the judgment ring on the moving disk.

00:02:18.533 --> 00:02:25.733
Hit each note as the scan line crosses it.

00:02:25.733 --> 00:02:34.900
Six note shapes share one hit time.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:42.267
Pause the chart, then resume the run.

00:02:42.267 --> 00:02:51.300
Review accuracy, best combo and judgment counts.
